        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Tennessee Valley Authority\n- Infrastructure: Hiwassee Dam, Wilbur Dam\n- Places: Hiawassee, Tennessee, Wilbur Lake, Carter County, Johnson County\n- People: Billy Bland\n\nFacts:\n- Wilbur Dam is the highest hydroelectric dam in the Tennessee Valley Authority system.\n- Wilbur Dam is located in Carter County and Johnson County at Wilbur Lake.\n- Hiwassee Dam is the third highest dam in the Tennessee Valley Authority system.\n- Hiwassee Dam is next to Hiawassee, Tennessee.\n- Billy Bland is from Tennessee.",
